  <problem>
    <para> In Step \(n\), what is the number of dots in Pattern 2?</para>
      </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para>\(n \cdot n\) or \(n^2\)</para>
  </solution></exercise>
